            <li>Data Structures & Computational Algorithms</li>
            <li>Git Version Control & GitHub Collaborative Pipelines</li>
            <li>Visual Studio Code & IDE Customization</li>
            <li>IntelliJ IDEA & Java Development Kits</li>
            <li>Web Standards (Semantic HTML5, Modern CSS, ES6+ JS)</li>
            <li>Astro Static Site Architecture & TypeScript</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <!-- Technical Background -->
        <div class="skills-card hud-panel cad-frame">
          <div class="skills-card-header">
            <span class="skills-icon">📐</span>
            <h3>TECHNICAL BACKGROUND</h3>
          </div>
          <ul class="skills-list">
            <li>Advanced CAD / BIM Workflows</li>
            <li>AutoCAD Drafting & Coordinate Standards</li>
            <li>Autodesk Revit & Building Information Modeling</li>
            <li>Parametric Logic & Computational Modeling</li>
            <li>Visual Programming Concepts (Dynamo / Grasshopper)</li>
            <li>Architectural Detailing & Fabrication Drawings</li>
